  "disclosure": {
    "what": "the three-arm freeze originally pinned the payload-acquisition freeze and its amendment as sources; the acquisition freeze pins the three-arm freeze (it needs the authority for the task set)",
    "problem": "those two pins form a cycle: each file's hash would have to depend on the other's, so no pair of hashes can be simultaneously correct",
    "resolution": "the three-arm freeze no longer pins the acquisition freeze or its amendment; the acquisition batch is a separate, completed batch with its own freeze, manifest, results and audit, so nothing it needs is unverified by this change",
    "verified": "both freezes are self-hash fixed points and every source they do pin matches its recorded hash",
    "no_paid_request": "this disclosure was written without issuing any API request"
